WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280 align:center
The draft says the cost stays constant.
It leaves out the pricing condition.

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:07.800 align:center
Green marks the missing condition
in the staged proposal.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:13.080 align:center
The author rewrites the added phrase.
The saved draft stays untouched.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:17.720 align:center
Accept saves the author’s wording.
Undo is still available.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:22.360 align:center
Undo restores the earlier sentence
and reopens the proposal.
